====== Routerich AX3000 ======

Routerich AX3000 is an indoor wireless router based on the MediaTek MT7981BA SoC, with four 10/100/1000 Ethernet ports (3xLAN + 1xWAN), dual band 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax (MIMO 2x2) WiFi, 256 MB of DDR3 RAM, 128 MB of SPI NAND storage, USB port and six external non-detachable antennas.

{{ :media:routerich:ax3000.jpg?direct&400 |Routerich AX3000}}

